[00:23.33]I woke up to the fire,
[00:23.33]我随焰火醒来
[00:25.28]A quiet world that needed just a little extra light
[00:25.28]静悄悄的世界，缺一点点光怪
[00:30.32]I reached for a burst of colors,
[00:30.32]抓起一把缤纷
[00:32.58]painting over shadows till the black turns into white
[00:32.58]覆过阴影，将漆黑涂成纯白
[00:37.50]Baked a sweet illusion,
[00:37.50]烤出一片甜梦
[00:39.57]raining sugar down to turn the heavy world around
[00:39.57]再下场糖雨，把凝重的世界化开
[00:44.46]We're living in the moment
[00:44.46]我们活在此刻
[00:46.66]like tomorrow never never ever will arrive
[00:46.66]就当明日不愿到来
[00:51.40]Ba ee ya ee ba ba ee ya ee
[00:54.84]Ba ee ya ee yeah~
[00:58.30]Ba ee ya ee ba ba ee ya ee
