[01:03.46]It's time to light up!
[01:03.46]时刻已到，点亮舞台！
[01:05.41]We don't care if all the world falls down tonight
[01:05.41]今夜天翻地覆？无碍！
[01:08.90]We just wanna lose ourselves beyond the sky
[01:08.90]只想放飞自我，嗨到天外！
[01:12.38]Turn it up and let the miracles arrive
